  "text": "Case note: CS(COMM) 1138/2022\nClient: Bhavana Mehra (textile trader, Vadodara)\nOpposing party: Das Exports\nCourt: Gujarat High Court, before Justice Arvind Bhargava\nFiled on: 19 March 2022\nClaim amount: Rs 2,96,00,000\nIssue: geographical-indication dispute. The rival product uses the protected regional name on its label.\nAdvice given: Rely on the registered GI certificate and seek an injunction against the infringing label.\nOutcome: An injunction against the infringing label was granted.\nRecommended next step: Seek damages.\nWitness: Kavya Bhatt",
